# Offline tooling the image never runs: fixture/weight generation, calibration
# sweeps, the e2e and screenshot drivers, the share-card renderer. Note these
# two patterns are ANCHORED AT THE CONTEXT ROOT — unlike the `**/` ones above
# they exclude only the top-level directories, so web/scripts/ (which holds the
# glossary prerender that `npm run build` actually runs) is deliberately
# unaffected. Anything the build needs must live inside a workspace for exactly
# that reason: a build step under tools/ passes every local check and then
# fails only in CI's docker job.
scripts
tools
